                                                "sense_id": "bb2477fa-820a-3414-9a82-806c04ea1203",
                                                "text": "He semeth a sysmatyke\nOr els an heretike,\nFor fayth in hym is faynte."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6a54ff40-376f-4338-b222-57e1ffa2d66b",
                                                "sense_id": "bb2477fa-820a-3414-9a82-806c04ea1203",
                                                "text": "Amid heretics and schismatics, spoilers of the church’s lands, and scoffers at saints and sacraments, there remains a remnant."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
